**定义 3.1（插值子式及其完整系数）。** For real variables $q,s,u$, define

$$
\begin{aligned}
Z&=2s+1,\\
A_0&=40(1-q)Z,& B_0&=28(1-q)s+8+q+9q^2-18u,\\
B_1&=(15q/2-5)s-2q-1-5q^2/2+5u,
&A_1&=B_1+4(3q-1)Z,\\
B_3&=9u-(1+7q/2)s+1-10q-9q^2/2,
&A_3&=3B_3+2(1-q)Z,\\
C_{ij}&=A_iB_j-A_jB_i\qquad(i,j\in\{0,1,3\}).
\end{aligned}                                                   \tag{3.1}
$$

